{"seq":23,"t":"2026-11-12T09:08:53.944Z","dir":"out","ok":true,"cmd":"mg","result":{"id":"phone-chat","type":"PhoneChatMinigame","title":"Your Phone","isActive":true,"available":true,"returnsToContainer":false,"isComplete":false,"result":null,"text":"×\n85%\n←\nAgent HaX\nThat noise is a cross-cut shredder. It's been running since before you landed.\n04:45\nShutter's his round. The office door's quieter.\n04:45\nNight guard. Twenty-four. Not ours, not theirs. Don't hurt him.\n04:45\nQuintero's going to hate that she was right if this goes badly. Let's not.\n04:45\nThe office door. I'll pick it.\n04:45\nGood. It's the west door. That's the front desk, and nowhere near his torch.\n04:45\nWho else is inside?\n04:45\nMargaret Sorensen runs the place. County clerk for twenty years before this.\n04:45\nA clerk's on tonight, and an IT contractor, Jesse Tran. Viral Dynamics' staff files have a Tran in them.\n04:45\nOnce you're in, set the laptop up in the reading room and get me into their catalogue. It's how we find out what Sorensen's burning.\n04:45\nOn my way.\n04:45\nShe's still feeding it.\n04:45\nTheir ledger's open on my screen. There's an entry you need to see.\n04:45\nThe ledger's live. Twenty-three placements, forty-seven candidates.\n04:46\nAnd a legacy section, older than any list we've ever had off them.\n04:46\nOne legacy entry, codename WREN. Updated on day ten, in Sorensen's hand. \"Assigned TF Null, Montana operation.\"\n04:46\n1. TF Null. That's the raid team.\n2. Who is WREN?\n Add to Notepad\nClose","controls":[{"index":0,"label":"×","id":"minigame-close","classes":"minigame-close-button","disabled":false},{"index":1,"label":"←","id":"back-button","classes":"back-button","disabled":false},{"index":2,"label":"1. TF Null. That's the raid team.","id":null,"classes":"choice-button","disabled":false},{"index":3,"label":"2. Who is WREN?","id":null,"classes":"choice-button","disabled":false},{"index":4,"label":"Add to Notepad","id":"minigame-notebook","classes":"minigame-button","disabled":false},{"index":5,"label":"Close","id":"minigame-cancel","classes":"minigame-button","disabled":false}],"fields":[],"npcId":"agent_0x99","phoneId":"player_phone","contacts":[],"awaitingContactSelection":false,"conversationActive":true,"dialogue":{"npcId":"agent_0x99","text":"","choices":[{"number":1,"index":0,"text":"TF Null. That's the raid team."},{"number":2,"index":1,"text":"Who is WREN?"}],"awaitingChoice":true,"ended":false},"se":{"characterId":null,"bar":null,"tells":[],"band":0}}}
